# "CONTROL OMEGA-KERNEL-GATE-WIRING/<name> FAILED_AS_REQUIRED" (kernel/scripts/omega_gate_wiring.sh --self-test; no-<tool>-<step> are the missing-tool runs of each step's need list); tests/gates/run.sh step_verdict fails the step
